{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2690540/extras/buildcardnew.gif?t=1744132760\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Faith in Despair</strong> is a grimdark roguelike deckbuilder where you build your own cards using triggers, actions and modifiers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your own cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Seek devastating synergies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight procedurally generated demons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect loot from fallen enemies to enhance your deck</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Vanquish hand-crafted bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeat Death at his own game to stay alive</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock new starter decks with unique playstyles</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is in active development. Join the Discord to share your suggestions and feedback. </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2690540?t=1744132760","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2690540/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744132760","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2690540/eba1e9200b649ff92424a898f40c8922462463e2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744132760","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2690540/eba1e9200b649ff92424a898f40c8922462463e2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744132760","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared